{"id":"vod_zy360_67718","vodId":"67718","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"记录的地平线","name_cn":"记录的地平线","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全25集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241106-1/72fc58d6d93f383beaa10966119e9df0.jpg"},"summary":"《幻境神话》是家喻户晓的网络游戏，在第十二次资料片更新之时，一场意外的发生竟然将三万名玩家困在了游戏构筑的虚拟世界之中。老牌玩家城惠（寺岛拓笃配音）就是其中的一员，现实中个性内向的他在游戏里却极其富有领导才能，深受同伴的信赖和喜爱。恐惧和绝望笼罩在被困在游戏里的玩家的头顶上，个性开朗直爽大大咧咧的战士直继（前野智昭配音）、拥有可爱外貌和强大实力的刺客晓（加藤英美里配音）联同城惠站了出来，创立了工会“记录的地平线”，他们从大都市秋叶原开始出发，踏上冒险的旅途，决心开拓出属于他们的世界，找到脱出的方法。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-06 13:59:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/96r9BEve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/tmFd4HnF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/HB2pShOQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/NG2zggek/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/bxqyGRel/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/hohDJwnF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/qoNhlIhu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/IK9EEkFK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/7mWnSoZX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/ZhCRdX94/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/dr9YN2jQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/BZh9xMB9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/BwSbztDF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/7a0RyPLm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/3Ers7yV4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16话","url"